      "question": "<p>A fixed point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> lies on a straight line.</p><p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> moves along the straight line.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t \\geq 0\"></span>, the distance, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"s\"></span> metres, of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"s = \\frac{1}{3} t^3 - \\frac{5}{2} t^2 + 6t\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find the acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at each of the times when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is at instantaneous rest.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the total distance travelled by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> in the interval <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 \\leq t \\leq 4\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
